  "risk_notes": "The refactor removes all accessor methods, which may affect external code that relies on them. If the project uses these methods for validation, logging, or future extension, a more nuanced approach (e.g., using @property with minimal logic) might be preferable. The change also alters the public API, so thorough regression testing is required."
